    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "About"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Hey, I’m Waquar"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "A tech enthusiast who has been exploring the world of technology since 2020. What started as a simple interest in Minecraft slowly turned into something much bigger."
    },
    {
      "kind": "attribute",
      "tag": "span",
      "name": "aria-hidden",
      "value": "true"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "A"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Where it started"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Back then I played Minecraft, created servers, configured plugins, set up permissions and experimented with features — just for fun. I was not doing it for money or to build a career. I was simply curious about how things worked behind the scenes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "B"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "From curiosity to craft"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "That curiosity eventually led me to Discord bot development, automation, websites, and now AI-powered development. Over time technology became more than a hobby. I started exploring how things are built, how different systems work together, and how an idea can turn into something people can actually use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "C"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Where I am today"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Right now I am focused on learning, building and experimenting with AI, software development, web technologies and automation. I use AI tools to develop faster and bring ideas to life, but I am always interested in understanding what is happening behind the code, not just generating it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "D"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "What’s ahead"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "I am still learning and I have a long way to go — but that is exactly what excites me about this field. There is always something new to explore, something to build, or a problem to solve. My goal is simple: keep learning, keep building, and turn ideas into real products people find useful."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "I am not here to pretend I know everything. I am here to see how far curiosity, consistency and the willingness to experiment can take me."
    },
