    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Outside the code"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Gaming & tinkering"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Minecraft is where all of this actually began. I spent my time building and running servers, configuring plugins, setting up permissions and pulling apart different features to see what they could do — purely for the fun of it. Those late-night experiments with redstone-level tinkering are the reason I wanted to know how everything else worked too."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Minecraft servers"
    },
