    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "The name behind the site"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Eternalz"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "Eternalz is a brand name for a brand that does not exist yet. I came up with it, liked it, and started putting it on everything I build — every bot, every site, every experiment that goes anywhere."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "value": "The hope is that it grows into something: Eternalz at the top, with Eternalz Studios and Eternalz Tech underneath it. Right now there's nothing in it but room — which is exactly the fun part. The name is already waiting."
    },
